{{! Shown once above the page content when the system cannot do everything.
    A disabled button with no explanation reads as a broken application, so the
    reason is stated here rather than repeated beside every control.

    Rendered from base.mustache on a full page load and prepended directly on a
    content-only render, so it survives navigation either way. }}
{{#degraded}}
<div class="notice warn" id="capability-banner">
  <strong>Some actions are unavailable.</strong>
  <ul style="margin:6px 0 0 18px">
    {{#capability_reasons}}<li>{{action}} - {{reason}}</li>{{/capability_reasons}}
  </ul>
</div>
{{/degraded}}
